' plan-99: a negative `ms` on `os::sleep` raises `ErrInvalidArgument` (77050002)
' BEFORE sleeping, and before the arena's worker back-pointer is even read — so the
' rejection is identical on the main thread and in a worker. Left uncaught here, it
' aborts the program with the standard runtime-error report (exit 255).
IMPORT io
IMPORT os

FUNC main AS Integer
  os::sleep(-1)
  io::print("unexpected: sleep returned")
  RETURN 1
END FUNC
